  "title": "Fried Empanadas",
  "description": "Try this easy empanada recipe for two dozen crispy empanadas filled with a mixture of seasoned beef, sweet raisins, and tender hard-cooked eggs.",
  "authors": [
    "CNCOOK"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-03T23:32:25-04:00",
